*> A Xoroshiro128++ generator state or a positional factory (docs/protocol/10 sections 2.1 to 2.5): two
*> unsigned 64-bit words. Used with the programs of core/src/rng.cob (XORO-*).
 01 XR-STATE.
    05 XR-LO                BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
    05 XR-HI                BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
